<title>USA: Kimball International raises dividends.</title>
<headline>Kimball International raises dividends.</headline>
<dateline>JASPER, Ind. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kimball International Inc said Tuesday it raised the quarterly dividends on its class B and class A common shares by 12 percent.</p>
<p>The quarterly dividend on the class B shares was raised to $0.29 a share from $0.26 a share, the company said.</p>
<p>The quarterly dividend on its class A shares increased to $0.2875 from $0.2575, Kimball said.</p>
<p>The dividends are payable July 15 to shareholders of record on June 25.</p>
<p>		-- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
